<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners buy 156.16 mln rand S.Africa bonds Thur.</title>
<headline>Foreigners buy 156.16 mln rand S.Africa bonds Thur.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers of 156.16 million rand worth of bonds on Thursday after buying 732.68 million rand's worth on Wednesday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
